keyVotes.background:
Budget and Management Analyst Jennifer Wright presented the amendments, including:
- school capital reallocations and phase 1 bond projects (net increase of $7,431,337);
- $1,860,000 for courthouse architect fees;
- a $1,000,000 COPS grant for Sheriff's radios with a $250,000 match;
- $200,000 for Helene facility repairs;
- $123,103 for a school projects project manager.
